  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "咳，咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "隕星！我們擊退了雪怪小隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "確實，我有點低估你們羅德島了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "下手是不是，還是太輕了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（手指已經沒有知覺了......可惡......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......怎麼回事.....？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "寒流......還在凝聚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "這一次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "你們就不會那麼好運了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不好.......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "她是想吸收整片區域內的寒氣，一口氣爆發出來嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "——♩——♬——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——那種法術，會抽乾我們所有人的熱量！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這種規模，比起她剛才所使用的法術，龐大太多了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "就這樣結束吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "就讓純粹無瑕的冰霜，埋葬你們的憤怒吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......♩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "有什麼，阻止了寒冷繼續彙集......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "......咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "是你做的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "我不是說過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "不允許你......再前進了嗎......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "——拼盡全力用自己的法術，停滯了寒潮的聚流嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......真是個好孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "霜葉用冰刃，分割了氣流嗎......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但是，但是她......支撐不了多久！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "冰刃已經......快要碎裂了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......已經，夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "這是最後的機會了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "阿米婭......就是現在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "掩護我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "務必小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "立即開火，壓制整合運動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "隕星，去吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "我去了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？敵人朝著我們......衝過來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，她......她是衝向了雪怪小隊的霜星？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別，別想過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "射擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "呃......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "隕星！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "不是直接命中，沒什麼關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還，還能跑嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都說了！你憑什麼靠近雪怪們啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "繼續射擊！不要給她機會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "——糟了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "喀......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "不！！她被......她被擊中了，不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......小傷而已！這樣就想擋住我，還太早了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這還不夠，我必須......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "咳，咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（寒氣......顫動了一下？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "等等，寒氣的盡頭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我抓住這種感覺了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "難道說......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不管怎麼樣，只能試一把了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "擊中它吧——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "大家可都......相信著我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "————？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "羅德島的領袖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "她的法術，擊碎了我們埋設的源石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "——起霧了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "果然！那個霜星是靠小隊埋設的源石來創造寒潮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "隕星！！趁現在——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "霜葉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "我......一定......會救你！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "所以，等我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
